      "text": "📄 Ghalibaf: Iran disrupts ceasefire equation on paper and ground\n\n📌 Tehran, IRNA – Iranian Parliament Speaker Mohammad Bagher Ghalibaf says that Iran has disrupted the equation of having a ceasefire on paper while repeatedly violating it on the ground. Addressing the opposing party, and declares that until there is a genuine will to build trust, Iran's response will remain unchanged.\n\nGhalibaf, who also serves as the head of Iranian negotiating team, posted on his personal X account: We disrupted the equation of a ceasefire on paper and its repeated violation on the ground.\n​\nHe added that until you demonstrate a genuine will for trust-building, Iran's response will remain exactly the same.\n\n📲 @Irna_en​",
